{"seq":2,"slug":"pandas","title":"Pandas 数据处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/pandas","wordCount":954,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"pandas-数据处理\">Pandas 数据处理</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Pandas 是 Python 数据分析的核心库，提供了 DataFrame 和 Series 两种核心数据结构。它让结构化数据的读取、清洗、转换和分析变得直观高效。无论是处理 CSV 文件还是数据库查询结果，Pandas 都是首选工具。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Pandas 的一切设计都围绕 DataFrame 的<strong>列存储</strong>结构展开。DataFrame 的每一列是一个独立的 NumPy <code>ndarray</code>，不同列可以有不同的 dtype：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[DataFrame] --&gt; B[列 name: ndarray[object]&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[列 age: ndarray[int64]&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[列 score: ndarray[float64]&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[共享同一行索引 Index]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E\">graph TD\n  A[DataFrame] --&gt; B[列 name: ndarray[object]\"]\n  A --&gt; C[列 age: ndarray[int64]\"]\n  A --&gt; D[列 score: ndarray[float64]\"]\n  B --&gt; E[共享同一行索引 Index]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E</pre><p>这一结构决定了 Pandas 的性能特征：<strong>按列操作（如某列求均值）极快，按行迭代（如 <code>iterrows()</code>）很慢</strong>，因为后者要跨越多个数组逐行取值。由此得到两条核心约束——优先做列方向的向量化运算，避免逐行循环。</p>\n<p>围绕&quot;读入 → 探索 → 清洗 → 变换 → 聚合 → 合并&quot;的数据流水线，Pandas 提供三组关键 API：<code>groupby().agg()</code> 做缩减聚合、<code>transform()</code> 做保持原形状的组内变换、<code>merge</code>/<code>concat</code> 做表间拼接。新代码还可选择 Polars（Rust 引擎、多线程、支持惰性求值）作为高性能替代。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心数据结构\">核心数据结构</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>类比</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Series</code></td>\n<td>1D</td>\n<td>带索引的一维数组</td>\n<td>单列数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DataFrame</code></td>\n<td>2D</td>\n<td>带索引的表格</td>\n<td>多列结构化数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pandas as pd&#10;&#10;s = pd.Series([10, 20, 30], index=[&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;, &quot;c&quot;])&#10;&#10;df = pd.DataFrame({&#10;    &quot;name&quot;: [&quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;Bob&quot;, &quot;Charlie&quot;],&#10;    &quot;age&quot;: [25, 30, 35],&#10;    &quot;score&quot;: [90.5, 85.0, 92.3],&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.Series([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">index</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.DataFrame({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Charlie\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">92.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DataFrame 的内部实现基于 NumPy ndarray——每一列是一个独立的 ndarray，不同列可以有不同的 dtype。这种列存储设计使得按列操作（如计算某列的均值）非常高效，但按行迭代则较慢（需要跨越多个数组）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据读写\">数据读写</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"df = pd.read_csv(&quot;data.csv&quot;)&#10;df = pd.read_excel(&quot;data.xlsx&quot;, sheet_name=&quot;Sheet1&quot;)&#10;df = pd.read_json(&quot;data.json&quot;)&#10;df = pd.read_parquet(&quot;data.parquet&quot;)&#10;&#10;df.to_csv(&quot;output.csv&quot;, index=False)&#10;df.to_parquet(&quot;output.parquet&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.read_csv(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"data.csv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.read_excel(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"data.xlsx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sheet_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Sheet1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.read_json(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"data.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.read_parquet(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"data.parquet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.to_csv(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"output.csv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">index</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.to_parquet(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"output.parquet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>读取函数</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>文件大小</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CSV</td>\n<td><code>read_csv</code></td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>通用交换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parquet</td>\n<td><code>read_parquet</code></td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>大数据分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Excel</td>\n<td><code>read_excel</code></td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>业务报表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td><code>read_json</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>API 数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>读取大型 CSV 文件时，可以通过 <code>usecols</code> 只加载需要的列、<code>dtype</code> 指定列类型避免自动推断开销、<code>chunksize</code> 分块读取避免内存溢出。例如 <code>pd.read_csv(&quot;big.csv&quot;, usecols=[&quot;id&quot;, &quot;value&quot;], dtype={&quot;id&quot;: &quot;int32&quot;})</code> 可以显著减少内存占用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据探索\">数据探索</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"df.head()&#10;df.info()&#10;df.describe()&#10;df.shape&#10;df.dtypes&#10;df.isnull().sum()&#10;df.value_counts(&quot;category&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.head()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.info()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.describe()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.dtypes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.isnull().sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.value_counts(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据清洗\">数据清洗</h2><h3 id=\"缺失值处理\">缺失值处理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"df.dropna(subset=[&quot;name&quot;])&#10;df.fillna({&quot;age&quot;: df[&quot;age&quot;].median(), &quot;score&quot;: 0})&#10;df[&quot;age&quot;] = df[&quot;age&quot;].interpolate()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.dropna(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">subset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df.fillna({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shi